WEBVTT

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.870
We're going to hand out flyers
outside the station this afternoon.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:40.970
Yes.

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:42.170
Homemade lunch?

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.370
You don't have to hide it

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.540
It's a wiener that
looks like a crab!

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:54.420
Why you little...!

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.620
Wh-What?

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.330
You got a toots
making this for you?

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:00.220
It's not like that.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.260
Oh, c'mon! Don't deny it!

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.840
This lunch says
"I love you" all over it.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.470
If that ain't lunch made
with love, what is?!

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.940
And you act like
it's no big deal.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:15.570
Want some tea?

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.570
It makes me happy,
but it hurts...

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:31.910
Really?

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.320
Yagami saw him.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:38.090
Mr. Godai really works
at a cabaret?!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.590
He's not at
the preschool anymore?

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:41.870
I guess not.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.840
I can't believe it!

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:46.310
Maybe it suits him.

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:49.870
He's the type to bring out the
maternal instinct in women.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:53.000
I bet the hostesses are taking
special care of him.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.460
What are you going to do?

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:55.220
About what?

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.720
Someone might
seduce Mr. Godai.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:59.780
He's the type to
go with the flow.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.410
He's not like that

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:07.960
Sir! Sir!
Our girls are hot!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.430
I'm sure there's
a good reason for this.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.940
If we don't finish
cleaning soon,

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.090
we'll never
get out of here.

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:16.660
Right. Let's get this done.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.370
Hello.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.600
Yes?

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:24.970
Oh, hi Yagami.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.100
Is Mr. Godai here?

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:29.250
He's not back yet.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.310
So he already
headed for work?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:31.990
Work?

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:35.380
Don't pretend you
don't know. I saw him.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.930
How could you let him take
a job like that, Manager?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.650
Godai seems to enjoy
going to work every day.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.340
I doubt it.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.370
I'm sure he took that job
because he had no choice.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.560
It doesn't seem
like that to me.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:58.870
Just a minute.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:03.150
Hi.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.090
Long time no see.
Godai's not home yet.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.190
I know.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.810
He's probably at work
at the cabaret, right?

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.250
I saw him.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.610
Let me hear what you
got to say. Come.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.200
Tomorrow?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.580
Yes. It's been a while since
the two of us had dinner.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.290
Unless you have
other plans?

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:35.940
No, but.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.850
Then I'll come by to pick
you up tomorrow evening.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.430
He's so pushy.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.870
Oh? Did she leave?

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:00.060
Come in!

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:06.910
You Sir! How about an evening
in dreamland with a hot girl

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.500
for just 3,OOO yen?!

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.920
Take advantage of
our limited-time offer!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.120
A hot girl?!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.690
Dreamland!?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.820
We'd love to take advantage!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.880
You're so mean, Godai.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.620
You have to tell us if you've
decided to make a comeback.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.040
Yeah.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.800
And we heard you've been
fired at preschool!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.130
So you've been letting the manager
make you lunch every day,

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.480
and you've been working
at a cabaret?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.630
She knows?!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.440
Only we do.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.290
We'll continue to be friends,
won't we?

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.710
Let's celebrate
Godai's comeback!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.190
Why?!

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:59.330
So, Godai was working
at a preschool?

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.460
No wonder he's so
great with our kids.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:08.370
He's been such a help. He's
so great, my kids adore him.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.830
I wish he'd work here forever.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.010
Me, too.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.120
Here's to Godai's return!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.380
Cheers!

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.490
Cheers!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.620
What shall we do next?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.360
Godai, what are you
going to do?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.100
Those bozos are putting
everything on your tab

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.130
and having a ball

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.440
I don't know what
they've got on you,

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.370
but I told you to get rid
of the likes of them.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.980
If only I could.

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:43.810
What's wrong, Uncle?

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.380
Godai!?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.160
C'mon! Let's go.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.730
It makes me so happy that we can all
go home together again!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.930
I'm not happy at all!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.190
I wonder where
those three are?

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.480
And Godai's been coming
home late, too.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.630
We're home.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:19.740
Welcome home.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.920
Were you all out together?

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.950
We've been with Godai.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:28.190
From the station, where
we ran into each other.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.550
I hope we run into
you again tomorrow.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.620
Godai, the lunch container...?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:35.950
Yes.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.080
Thanks again.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.760
I wonder where
he's been eating those?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.200
It seems everyone's
drunk tonight

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.760
Let's drink some more.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.040
Let's!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:49.700
Good night.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.050
Good night.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:58.490
Godai, do you have
your umbrella?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.140
Yes.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.750
Here's your lunch.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.310
Thank you.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.820
Manager, you don't have to
make me lunch from tomorrow.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.800
Why?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.560
Because.  Um...

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.070
Lunch money can add up.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.680
Don't even worry about it.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.540
The truth is.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:21.690
I love making lunches.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:26.440
By the way, you've been coming
home rather late every night

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:31.100
I'm more curious about
what he does during the day.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.440
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.580
I'm leaving.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.720
What were you talking about?

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.090
What?

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.780
Another fancy lunch!

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.360
You better take
good care of her.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.330
Nowadays, it's not
easy to find a girl

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.680
who'd go through
that kinda trouble.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:03.180
Thank you, Manager.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.030
The sky doesn't look good.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.720
Is Godai here?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.730
Godai's out,
putting up posters.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.970
Are you the girl
who makes his lunch?

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.010
Lunch?

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:33.890
I'm back.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.810
Hey, Lover Boy. She's here.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.280
You know, "her"

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.720
"Her"?

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:43.430
C'mon, you know!
Your lunch-maker!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.090
Can't be!

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.260
C'mon. Go in.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.940
How do I look?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.720
Are you insane, Yagami?!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.670
I've decided to
work here from today.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:07.580
You're working here because
you owe them money, right?

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:09.550
Mrs. Ichinose told me.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.210
She also told me

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.920
that the manager's been
making you lunch every day.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.590
I want to do something
to help you, too.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.220
Never mind!
Take that thing off!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.930
I'll introduce you
to everyone. Come.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.190
I'm sure you'll be
the most popular girl

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.230
and rake in money.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:32.280
Wait! You can't let a high-school student
work as a hostess!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.180
High school?!

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.660
Young lady, please change
back into your clothes

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.060
and go home right now.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.950
I can't let a high-school
student work here.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.760
We do have moral standards.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.960
B-But

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.350
All right.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.010
Be brave and go
over the bridge.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.560
If I go over
the rainbow bridge,

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:10.380
I'll see Mommy again,
Ponkichi told himself.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:14.580
The giant rainbow bridge
across the crisp blue sky--

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:19.380
Godai, that high-school girl
is your lunch-maker, isn't she?

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.070
well

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.850
You're doing much better
than I would have guessed.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.860
Please don't interrupt.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.030
I'll help you get customers
after I put these kids to bed.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.270
I'm not worried about that.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.530
I came to tell you that
those sponges are here again.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.670
Want me to chew 'em out?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.730
No thanks.
I'll do it myself.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.560
You sure?

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.070
Who cares!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.680
Let's sit down, sir.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:51.650
I can't believe you're here
every night.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.780
I want to be here
every night forever.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.530
Sure. Me, too.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.080
Let's not hold back!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.490
You!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.170
Hi, Godai!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.290
Hey there!

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.200
We're helping
ourselves, thanks.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:09.560
Listen! This is your
final night on my tab.

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.940
Tonight, I'm going to tell
Manager everything.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.240
You're serious,
aren't you?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:18.880
Yes.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.020
Last night fever!

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.280
Here's to the last night!

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:25.290
Let's party!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.320
You really better
get rid of them soon.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:34.210
Yes.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:42.190
I'm sorry. Perhaps
I was rather pushy.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.680
Yes-- I mean, no.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.230
But if I don't see you
like this once in a while,

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:47.880
I'm afraid you'll
forget me.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:58.050
This isn't a very
nice neighborhood.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:12:58.970
No.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:14.820
Godai...!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:35.550
How can I admit all this after
I've put up such a front?

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.830
Manager's going to be shocked.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.480
Godai!?

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:54.530
We're going home now.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.820
Don't forget your promise.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:57.820
I know!

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.590
Here's to Godai's bravery.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.370
Banzai!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.370
Banzai!

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.110
Banzai!

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:12.800
Banzai! Good luck, you!

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:19.840
It's disappointing that
tonight was our last.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.300
Yeah.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:28.440
I can't believe Godai's
working at a cabaret.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.130
Did you know?

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:31.790
No.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:36.500
He looked pretty good
in that happi coat

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.870
Why, Godai...?

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:51.520
Thank you for dinner.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.150
I'll call you again.
Good night.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.040
Good night.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.640
Were you on a date?

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.430
No.

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.440
I thought you were
in love with Mr. Godai.

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:25.410
I don't think Godai will
be home anytime soon.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.790
I know he works at a cabaret

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.390
and that he left his job
at the preschool.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:37.050
You didn't know anything,
and you're the manager?

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:40.420
What do you mean he left
his job at the preschool?

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:45.140
I feel so sorry
for Mr. Godai.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.070
And I can't do
anything to help him.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.440
Yagami.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:08.530
Why don't you
get a clue?!

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.420
I'm so worried about him,
I can't leave him alone!

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.410
Yagami...?

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.630
Why didn't anyone tell me?

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.300
Why was I the
only clueless one?

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.910
Why? Why?

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:45.420
No, I can't just leave.
Be brave!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.120
I thought you were
going to tell her?

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.120
Chicken.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:53.240
Looks like we'll be able to
keep drinking on your tab!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:58.860
I'll do it! I'm about
to tell Manager--

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.370
Did you want
to talk to me?

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:03.440
What is it?

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.010
I...

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.690
The truth is, I...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.810
You're such a wimp.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.220
Shall I tell her for you?

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:14.690
I know already.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.960
You don't need
lunch anymore,

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.620
and you're no longer working
at the preschool, right?

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.430
How did you..?

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:28.230
Well, good night!

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.060
Manager!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.710
Manager.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.020
How did she find out?

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.110
I told her nothing.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.480
Wasn't me.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:57.960
Bye.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.040
What? No homemade lunch today?

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.540
Probably never again.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.920
Your girl left you?

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.280
I know the pain.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:58.640
I'm upset that
you all deceived me.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.320
We couldn't help it.
He had a gag order.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.820
I can see why he wanted to keep
his cabaret job a secret,

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.960
but did he have to lie about
leaving his preschool job?

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:11.900
I don't know why he had to
hide all this from me.

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.890
Maybe he couldn't
tell you the truth

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.970
because you started
making him lunches.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.370
So it's my fault?!

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:21.370
That's not what I mean.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:24.640
Did he ever act like he
wanted to tell you something?

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.610
Here. Your lunch.

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:34.620
Um... But...

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.460
Please eat it at
the preschool.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.220
Hello?

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.540
You're from the preschool...?

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.480
Yes. Is Godai here?

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:56.370
He's out right now.

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:59.220
Okay. Would you please
give this to him?

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:00.580
What's this?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.230
It's the preschool teacher
certification exam study guide.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.760
Godai told me he wanted
to take a look at it.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.050
He did?

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.860
How come Godai got
fired from preschool?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.470
Did he cause
some kinda trouble?

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:16.890
It's just that we found a
new replacement teacher.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.000
That's it?

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.210
Yes.

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:27.370
That's nothing
to be ashamed about.

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:42.230
All he had to do was to give
me a simple explanation.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:48.820
He must have gone
through a lot, knowing him.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:58.900
I'm home.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.040
Hello.

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:05.340
I...

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:09.050
Here's a preschool teacher
certification exam study guide.

00:22:09.530 --> 00:22:12.080
One of the teachers at the
preschool brought it over today.

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:17.650
Th-Thank you. Good night.

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:20.240
Godai?

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.200
I wish you could
have told me.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:28.470
I think you tend to carry
more weight on your shoulders

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:33.040
than most people.
But it's just fate..

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:39.250
and I know things will
start going your way.

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:47.320
Please don't keep secrets
from me anymore.

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:51.700
Manager!

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:04.480
Bye!

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:06.800
Wait, Godai.

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:12.580
No matter what you do,
please do your best.

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:14.150
I will!

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:17.550
And um... Anyway.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:20.150
Here.

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.150
Manager, thank you!
Thank you!

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:32.590
What's that all about?

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:36.500
His girl must be back.

00:23:39.190 --> 00:23:40.210
Thank you, Manager.

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:51.560
Huh?! Asuna?

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:53.760
Yeah. She suddenly showed up.

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:55.650
She and the manager were
staring each other down.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.180
And then what happened?

00:23:57.390 --> 00:23:59.480
You'll find out next week.

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:03.310
Next: "Obsessive Love!
Asuna Just Won't Give Up!"

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:05.750
The young lady's got nerves!
